NAME
    clock - analog clock, stopwatch and countdown timer

SYNOPSIS
    clock

DESCRIPTION
    A graphical clock for the VNU desktop, rewritten from scratch (in
    C) after the classic clock-tui: an analog face over the `time`
    syscall (RTC, one-second resolution) with a digital read-out, a
    stopwatch and a countdown timer. The desktop advances it once per
    second through the GUI heartbeat; Esc closes the window.

KEYS
    1 2 3      switch mode: Clock / Stopwatch / Timer
    Space      start or pause the stopwatch, start or pause the timer
    r          reset the stopwatch or the timer
    l          record a lap (stopwatch mode)
    Esc        close the window

MOUSE
    Click the mode tabs to switch modes and the on-screen buttons to
    start, pause, lap, reset or tweak the timer duration.

SYSCALLS
    time      seconds since midnight from the RTC (0..86399)
    uptime    whole seconds since boot (RTC-delta)

FILES
    /apps/clock/bin   the program itself
